{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Again: Heartwell</strong> is a cozy slice of life narrative adventure dating sim with relaxing caf\u00e9 minigames. Customize your character, explore the top-down pixel art town map, make crepes, decorate your room, and navigate new friendships and romance in a new town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066420/extras/ffdb83e4c06d6a6371bd5a2840b9ed92.avif?t=1771476119\" width=1392 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066420/extras/5f9d78b313612262028e62e63d61cb24.avif?t=1771476119\" width=1105 height=1102 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066420/extras/e78310534286e23ef0e09fd1cec4dbb5.avif?t=1771476119\" width=1105 height=1102 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066420/extras/57e60e0fe46099a78986087fcbfc46bb.avif?t=1771476119\" width=1392 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your mom visit the isolated island of Heartwell for spring break to house-sit for your grandmother. Heartwell is a quiet, restricted-access island known for its strange rumors and unexplained sightings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There, you meet <strong>Marsh </strong>and<strong> Jade</strong>, fraternal twins whose relationship is strained in ways they refuse to talk about. Marsh is guarded and withdrawn. Jade is warm and playful. Getting to know them reveals how different they are and how far apart they\u2019ve grown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you spend time on the island, you begin experiencing headaches, dizzy spells, and an odd sense that something about Heartwell is affecting you more than anyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your time together is short, but meaningful. You promise to stay in touch, yet somehow, you lose contact...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, you return to Heartwell determined to reconnect, understand what pulled the twins apart, and uncover the truth behind the island that keeps slipping out of reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split your days between story events and free time. Hang out with friends, help at the caf\u00e9, or shop for new customization options. Each choice brings you closer to your favorite characters while revealing more about Heartwell\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066420/extras/b243903d11006b16c99074acd3696d02.avif?t=1771476119\" width=1392 height=259 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prologue - 2008</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066420/extras/9657715a62dcaa9ebddcabe15960ac3e.avif?t=1771476119\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066420/extras_big/9657715a62dcaa9ebddcabe15960ac3e.webp?t=1771476119 width=1560 height=760 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066420/extras/63ca386944ed17e194c9fe660a0e328a.avif?t=1771476119\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066420/extras_big/63ca386944ed17e194c9fe660a0e328a.webp?t=1771476119 width=1560 height=749 /></span><strong></strong><br><br>More characters coming soon...<br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>High School - 2012</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a